D18. This has a lot of pull—a verb. ~ LUG
D19. This causes much anger. ~ IRE
D20. What poets give their sweeties for Xmas. ~ ODE
D22. These kind of people have character. ~ REPUTABLE
D25. This is full of hops. ~ AEROPLANE
